WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.650
An AI scientist builds a protocol to summon the dead.

00:00:04.026 --> 00:00:07.950
Their voices, reconstructed from the words they left behind.

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:10.950
Then he disappears.

00:00:11.375 --> 00:00:16.750
Miranda Cale is hired to catalogue the papers, recordings, and
experiments left in his house.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.950
Eleven doors on the county plan. Twelve in her inventory.

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:23.900
A document describes her work before she does it.

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:32.150
Three isolated conversations produce the same interruption.

00:00:32.323 --> 00:00:34.350
The records should explain what happened.

00:00:34.591 --> 00:00:36.750
Instead, they seem to be waiting for her.

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:41.750
Did he build a convincing imitation?

00:00:41.891 --> 00:00:43.850
Did someone tamper with the evidence?

00:00:44.145 --> 00:00:47.600
Or did something answer that he could no longer control?

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:57.200
The deeper Miranda reads, the harder it becomes to tell whether
she is investigating the experiment...

00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:58.750
or becoming part of it.

00:01:03.350 --> 00:01:04.500
Using This Matter.

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:06.550
A Novel of the Companion Estate.

00:01:06.755 --> 00:01:10.550
A mystery about the voices we preserve, and the right to let go.

